  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strategic Sector Cooperation in The Maritime sector between Denmark and India, inception phase</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The focus of the inception phase project will be the establishment of a Centre of Excellence (CoE) on Green Shipping in India under the National Centre of Excellence on Ports and Green Shipping and the framework of the Memorandum of Understanding (MoU) on maritime issues signed by the Indian and Danish governments in January 2019 and renewed January 2022 as well as the joint Concept Note for Centre of Excellence in Green Shipping aiming at cultivating and accelerating the transition in the maritime sector.</narrative>
  </description>
